    <task id="Id_f220b99c-d567-4950-87f8-1478147a03eb" name="6.8 Adjudicar o objeto e homologar a licitação">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 71. Encerradas as fases de julgamento e habilita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, e exauridos os recursos administrativos, o processolicitat&amp;oacute;rio ser&amp;aacute; encaminhado &amp;agrave; autoridade superior, que poder&amp;aacute;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;I - determinar o retorno dos autos para saneamento de irregularidades;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;II - revogar a licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o por motivo de conveni&amp;ecirc;ncia e oportunidade;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;III - proceder &amp;agrave; anula&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, de of&amp;iacute;cio ou mediante provoca&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de terceiros, sempre que presenteilegalidade insan&amp;aacute;vel;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;IV - adjudicar o objeto e homologar a licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#C4BD97" />
