    </task>
    <task id="Id_b1f0aa43-1e3d-4834-8b2e-646086d594f2" name="6.7.1 Verificar  habilitação jurídica">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 66. A habilita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o jur&amp;iacute;dica visa a demonstrar a capacidade de o licitante exercer direitos e assumirobriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es, e a documenta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o a ser apresentada por ele limita-se &amp;agrave; comprova&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de exist&amp;ecirc;ncia jur&amp;iacute;dica da pessoa e,quando cab&amp;iacute;vel, de autoriza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para o exerc&amp;iacute;cio da atividade a ser contratada&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#C4BD97" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#746D47" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_d98773b7-0946-4933-a010-31f9b6288402</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_ce7565bf-4df3-4ef3-af34-5da975581708</outgoing>
      <resourceRole id="Id_4969b5eb-e47f-4d35-880d-bb3d4522bada">
        <q10:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q10="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">Municipios</q10:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
      <resourceRole id="Id_09f50bf9-0e31-400e-9531-83748b31b3a1">
        <q11:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q11="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">Licitantes</q11:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_230687a5-0784-4361-adb7-71c7aafe900e" name="6.7.2 Verificar habilitação técnica">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 67. A documenta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o relativa &amp;agrave; qualifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o t&amp;eacute;cnico-profissional e t&amp;eacute;cnico-operacional ser&amp;aacute; restrita a:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;I - apresenta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de profissional, devidamente registrado no conselho profissional competente, quando for ocaso, detentor de atestado de responsabilidade t&amp;eacute;cnica por execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de obra ou servi&amp;ccedil;o de caracter&amp;iacute;sticassemelhantes, para fins de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;II - certid&amp;otilde;es ou atestados, regularmente emitidos pelo conselho profissional competente, quando for o caso,que demonstrem capacidade operacional na execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de servi&amp;ccedil;os similares de complexidade tecnol&amp;oacute;gica eoperacional equivalente ou superior, bem como documentos comprobat&amp;oacute;rios emitidos na forma do &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0000ED;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 3&amp;ordm; do art. 88desta Lei;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;III - indica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do pessoal t&amp;eacute;cnico, das instala&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e do aparelhamento adequados e dispon&amp;iacute;veis para arealiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do objeto da licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, bem como da qualifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de cada membro da equipe t&amp;eacute;cnica que seresponsabilizar&amp;aacute; pelos trabalhos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;IV - prova do atendimento de requisitos previstos em lei especial, quando for o caso;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;V - registro ou inscri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o na entidade profissional competente, quando for o caso;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VI - declara&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de que o licitante tomou conhecimento de todas as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e das condi&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es locais para ocumprimento das obriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es objeto da licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#C4BD97" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#746D47" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_19164fa3-d906-4ddb-8092-266f55a92703</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_986d50dd-aff3-4ef1-882b-867ec9c8250f</outgoing>
      <resourceRole id="Id_2438c52e-4212-439e-90e8-f582c38f6df3">
        <q12:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q12="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">Municipios</q12:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
      <resourceRole id="Id_0401e29f-2244-4cb7-ae28-4ed64ad1c798">
        <q13:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q13="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">Licitantes</q13:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_98a9880d-e543-423b-8d1d-86e6cf212e16" name="6.7.4 Verificar habilitação econômica-financeira">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 69. A habilita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o econ&amp;ocirc;mico-financeira visa a demonstrar a aptid&amp;atilde;o econ&amp;ocirc;mica do licitante para cumprir asobriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es decorrentes do futuro contrato, devendo ser comprovada de forma objetiva, por coeficientes e &amp;iacute;ndicesecon&amp;ocirc;micos previstos no edital, devidamente justificados no processo licitat&amp;oacute;rio, e ser&amp;aacute; restrita &amp;agrave; apresenta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o daseguinte documenta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;I - balan&amp;ccedil;o patrimonial, demonstra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de resultado de exerc&amp;iacute;cio e demais demonstra&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es cont&amp;aacute;beis dos 2 (dois)&amp;uacute;ltimos exerc&amp;iacute;cios sociais;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;II - certid&amp;atilde;o negativa de feitos sobre fal&amp;ecirc;ncia expedida pelo distribuidor da sede do licitante.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#C4BD97" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#746D47" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_7ec456b3-3eb2-4472-b816-69364db97b4b</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_f78596a5-318a-407d-99f1-72f449b5c703</outgoing>
      <resourceRole id="Id_c03ed62a-3165-4cee-a3a1-1d37d9326699">
        <q14:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q14="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">Licitantes</q14:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
      <resourceRole id="Id_7fa9b260-92f6-49ff-8a87-8da9039c3a03">
        <q15:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q15="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">Municipios</q15:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_193c0424-0d7e-4443-98ca-c7a188bc9014" name="6.7.3 Verificar habilitação fiscal, social e trabalhista">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 68. As habilita&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es fiscal, social e trabalhista ser&amp;atilde;o aferidas mediante a verifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dos seguintes requisitos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;I - a inscri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o no Cadastro de Pessoas F&amp;iacute;sicas (CPF) ou no Cadastro Nacional da Pessoa Jur&amp;iacute;dica (CNPJ);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;II - a inscri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o no cadastro de contribuintes estadual e/ou municipal, se houver, relativo ao domic&amp;iacute;lio ou sede dolicitante, pertinente ao seu ramo de atividade e compat&amp;iacute;vel com o objeto contratual;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;III - a regularidade perante a Fazenda federal, estadual e/ou municipal do domic&amp;iacute;lio ou sede do licitante, ououtra equivalente, na forma da lei;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;IV - a regularidade relativa &amp;agrave; Seguridade Social e ao FGTS, que demonstre cumprimento dos encargos sociaisinstitu&amp;iacute;dos por lei;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;V - a regularidade perante a Justi&amp;ccedil;a do Trabalho;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VI - o cumprimento do disposto no inciso XXXIII do art. 7&amp;ordm; da Constitui&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o Federal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#C4BD97" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#746D47" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_4669f1c3-3a00-40c3-9129-1a898ff7a4d7</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_4f790102-9599-4e8d-8a76-a2a1d079e3db</outgoing>
